{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"A Friend","html":"<article id='sn1.53'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Saṁyutta Nikāya 1.53 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Linked Discourses 1.53 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>6. Jarāvagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>6. Old Age </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Mittasutta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>A Friend </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Kiṁsu pavasato mittaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“Who’s your friend while journeying? </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>kiṁsu mittaṁ sake ghare; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Who’s your friend at home? </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Kiṁ mittaṁ atthajātassa, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Who’s your friend in time of need? </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>kiṁ mittaṁ samparāyikan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Who’s your friend in lives to come?” </span></span></p>\n<p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Sattho pavasato mittaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“A caravan is your friend while journeying. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>mātā mittaṁ sake ghare; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Mother is your friend at home. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Sahāyo atthajātassa, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>An ally in time of need </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>hoti mittaṁ punappunaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>is a friend time and again. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Sayaṅkatāni puññāni, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>But the good deeds you’ve done yourself—</span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>taṁ mittaṁ samparāyikan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>that’s your friend in lives to come.” </span></span></p></blockquote></article>"}
